# Copy to .redaction-patterns.local (gitignored) and add terms that must never be committed,
# for example your organisation, customer or internal project names, or private hostnames.
# One extended regular expression (ERE, as used by grep -E) per line; '#' starts a comment.
# scripts/redaction_gate.sh reads this file and reports "file:line: local pattern" without
# echoing the matched value.
#
# Examples (replace with your own, never commit the real file):
# (?i) is not supported; use bracket classes for case-insensitivity.
# [Aa]cme[- ]?[Cc]orp
# internal-wiki\.corp\.invalid
# project-codename-[0-9]+
